  "bodyHash": "ZngaWKQ4jlU=",
  "content": "你好世界<h2 class=\"x-text-content-text-primary\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 24px;\">《魔力與工藝》是《魔法藝術2》的精神續作，為遊戲世界帶來嶄新的魔法體驗。</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"padding-left: 30px; text-align: center;\">打造並施放強大法術</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"e62-6 x-section\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<div class=\"e62-7 x-row x-container max width\">\n<div class=\"x-row-inner\">\n<div class=\"e62-8 x-col\">\n<div class=\"e62-10 x-text\" style=\"text-align: center;\">在《魔力與工藝》中，您能更全面地掌控法術的各個面向。<br />熟悉的法術形態、要素與修飾悉數回歸，並更加注重平衡性與穩定性。從70多種形態、要素與修飾中自由搭配（未來還會持續增加），實現您夢寐以求的大法師之路！</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"e62-10 x-text\" style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"e62-15 x-col\"><span class=\"e62-12 x-image\"> <img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://manaandartifice.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/inscription_table.jpg\" alt=\"圖片\" width=\"1024\" height=\"813\" /></span></div>\n<div class=\"e62-15 x-col\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"e62-15 x-col\">隨著進度推進，組合多重要素創造更強大的法術！&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"e62-15 x-col\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"e62-15 x-col\"><span class=\"e62-12 x-image\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://manaandartifice.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/book_of_rote.jpg\" alt=\"圖片\" width=\"1024\" height=\"813\" /></span></div>\n<div class=\"e62-15 x-col\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"e62-15 x-col\"><span class=\"e62-12 x-image\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://manaandartifice.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/wrath_lightning.jpg\" alt=\"圖片\" width=\"1024\" height=\"813\" /></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"e62-13 x-section\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<div class=\"e62-14 x-row x-container max width\">\n<div class=\"x-row-inner\">\n<h2 class=\"e62-15 x-col\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2 class=\"e62-15 x-col\" style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2 class=\"e62-15 x-col\" style=\"text-align: center;\">透過儀式施展更強大、更持久的魔法效果</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">儀式能建立極其強大的魔法效果。雖然需要大量準備工作，但能實現驚人奇蹟！<br />創造跨越遠距的傳送門、操控時間與天氣、召喚其他玩家，或是締結強力盟約。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"e62-15 x-col\"><span class=\"e62-16 x-image\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://manaandartifice.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/ritual_of_arcana-scaled.jpg\" alt=\"圖片\" width=\"1024\" height=\"685\" /></span></div>\n<div class=\"e62-15 x-col\"><span class=\"e62-16 x-image\"><br /><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://manaandartifice.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/ritual_of_aurora.jpg\" alt=\"圖片\" width=\"1024\" height=\"685\" /></span></div>\n<div class=\"e62-15 x-col\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"e62-17 x-col\">\n<div class=\"e62-19 x-text\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"e62-20 x-section\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<div class=\"e62-21 x-row x-container max width\">\n<div class=\"x-row-inner\">\n<div class=\"e62-22 x-col\">\n<div class=\"e62-23 x-text x-text-headline\">\n<div class=\"x-text-content\">\n<div class=\"x-text-content-text\">\n<h2 class=\"x-text-content-text-primary\" style=\"text-align: center;\">全新的附魔系統</h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"e62-24 x-text\" style=\"text-align: center;\">現在附魔是充滿樂趣的深度過程，且回報豐厚：您可以自主選擇想要的附魔效果！<br /><br />從燒製黏土板開始，到在秘法熔爐中冶煉材料，於神秘鐵砧上錘鍊符文，最後注入自身魔力（搭配必要催化劑）——整個過程充滿魔法力量感。</div>\n<div class=\"e62-24 x-text\" style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"e62-24 x-text\" style=\"text-align: center; padding-left: 30px;\"><img src=\"https://manaandartifice.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/manaweave_altar.png\" width=\"1024\" height=\"410\" /></div>\n<div class=\"e62-24 x-text\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"e62-24 x-text\" style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"e62-25 x-col\"><span class=\"e62-26 x-image\"> <img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://manaandartifice.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/runeic_anvil.jpg\" alt=\"圖片\" width=\"1024\" height=\"815\" /> </span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"e62-29 x-col\" style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<h2 class=\"e62-29 x-col\" style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2 class=\"e62-29 x-col\" style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;新增製作選項</h2>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">透過模組中多種新增的製作方式，體驗真正巫師的沉浸感。</p>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://manaandartifice.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/runeforge_2.jpg\" width=\"1024\" height=\"611\" /></p>\n<p><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://manaandartifice.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/eldrin_3.jpg\" width=\"1024\" height=\"623\" /></p>\n<h2 class=\"e62-29 x-col\" style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2 class=\"e62-29 x-col\" style=\"padding-left: 30px; text-align: center;\">在空中繪製魔法陣紋</h2>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 30px; text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"padding-left: 30px; text-align: center;\">嶄新的「魔紋編織」機制讓強大魔法效果觸手可及！<br />使用特殊魔杖，將自身魔力引導至面前空氣中繪製的圖形，編織複雜效果——例如召喚魔法典籍（類似終界箱的法術書），或為儀式注入魔力。<br />作為輔助選項，或單純不喜歡此機制的玩家，也可使用自動繪製魔紋的方塊。隨心所欲遊玩！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<div class=\"e62-27 x-section\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<div class=\"e62-28 x-row x-container max width\">\n<div class=\"x-row-inner\">\n<div class=\"e62-29 x-col\"><span class=\"e62-30 x-image\"><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://manaandartifice.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/manaweave.png\" alt=\"圖片\" width=\"717\" height=\"468\" /> </span></div>\n<div class=\"e62-31 x-col\">\n<h2 class=\"x-text-content-text-primary\"><br />探索魔法世界</h2>\n</div>\n<p><br />數十種新建築讓世界更加豐富多彩。</p>\n</div>\n<p><img src=\"https://manaandartifice.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/manaweave_cache.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1109\" height=\"744\" /></p>\n<div class=\"x-row-inner\">\n<div class=\"e62-31 x-col\">\n<p><img src=\"https://manaandartifice.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/potion_hut.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1093\" height=\"808\" /></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"e62-34 x-section\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<div class=\"e62-35 x-row x-container max width\">\n<div class=\"x-row-inner\">\n<div class=\"e62-36 x-col\">\n<div class=\"e62-37 x-text x-text-headline\">\n<div class=\"x-text-content\">\n<div class=\"x-text-content-text\">\n<h2 class=\"x-text-content-text-primary\" style=\"text-align: center;\">結交強力盟友，樹立危險敵人</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"e62-38 x-text\" style=\"text-align: center;\">透過陣營系統，與遠古巫師、妖精王庭，甚至地獄惡魔結盟！<br />每個陣營都有獨特優勢與劣勢，讓每次遊玩體驗都煥然一新。</div>\n<div class=\"e62-38 x-text\" style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"e62-38 x-text\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://manaandartifice.com/wp-content/uploads/2021/07/factions_new.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1085\" height=\"441\" /></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"e62-39 x-col\">\n<p><br /><img src=\"https://manaandartifice.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/broker.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1101\" height=\"778\" /><br /><br /><br /></p>\n<div class=\"e62-46 x-text x-text-headline\">\n<div class=\"x-text-content\">\n<div class=\"x-text-content-text\">\n<h2 class=\"x-text-content-text-primary\" style=\"text-align: center;\">引導式進程助您規劃下一步</h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"e62-47 x-text\" style=\"text-align: center;\">遊戲初期即可獲得名為「奧術之眼」的實用方塊。它會根據當前進度，分類顯示可進行的目標與可製作物品。<br />無需研究模組所有內容，只需按階層推進。這些階層設計符合遊戲自然進程，讓您在遊玩中自然成長！</div>\n<div class=\"e62-47 x-text\" style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"e62-41 x-section\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<div class=\"e62-42 x-row x-container max width\">\n<div class=\"x-row-inner\">\n<div class=\"e62-43 x-col\"><span class=\"e62-44 x-image\"> <img src=\"https://manaandartifice.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/occulus.jpg\" alt=\"圖片\" width=\"1024\" height=\"901\" /></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"e62-43 x-col\" style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"e62-43 x-col\" style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<div class=\"e62-48 x-section\" style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<div class=\"e62-49 x-row x-container max width\">\n<div class=\"x-row-inner\">\n<div class=\"e62-50 x-col\">\n<div class=\"e62-51 x-text x-text-headline\">\n<div class=\"x-text-content\">\n<div class=\"x-text-content-text\">\n<h2 class=\"x-text-content-text-primary\" style=\"text-align: center;\">讓典籍指引您的道路</h2>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"e62-52 x-text\" style=\"text-align: center;\">《奧術法典》會同步您的當前階層，在不造成資訊超載的前提下，顯示更多可製作內容的詳情。如果「奧術之眼」告訴您「能做什麼」，法典則說明「如何做」。<br />直觀的頁面佈局與配方說明，讓您清晰掌握每個步驟。</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"e62-53 x-col\"><span class=\"e62-54 x-image\"> <img src=\"https://manaandartifice.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/codex_2.jpg\" alt=\"圖片\" width=\"1024\" height=\"639\" /></span></div>\n<div class=\"e62-53 x-col\"><span class=\"e62-54 x-image\"><br /><img src=\"https://manaandartifice.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/codex.jpg\" alt=\"圖片\" width=\"1024\" height=\"639\" /></span></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"e62-53 x-col\" style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</div>\n<h2 class=\"e62-53 x-col\" style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2 class=\"e62-53 x-col\" style=\"text-align: center;\">使用構裝體實現自動化或組建私人軍隊</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">構裝體是極具成就感的自動化形式，能實現驚人功能——與方塊互動、分類物品、補充熔爐等等！就連製作過程本身也充滿魔法韻味。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">它們是完全模組化的。&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">每個構裝體由五部分組成：頭部、軀幹、腿部、左臂、右臂。每個部件賦予不同能力，例如攜帶物品、攻擊、水下呼吸等。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">每個部件可選用六種材質之一：木材、石頭、鐵、金、鑽石或黑曜石。還能混搭使用！材質組合會影響構裝體的移動速度、火焰抗性、浮空能力等屬性。&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; padding-left: 330px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; padding-left: 30px;\"><img src=\"https://manaandartifice.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/constructs-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1024\" height=\"639\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">最後，當您完成構裝體製作時，需為工作台周圍的8顆水晶注入元素親和。透過對水晶施法實現。整體親和會改變構裝體屬性，例如大地親和提升物理抗性，風之親和增加移動速度等。《奧術法典》詳載所有細節，無需盲目嘗試。整個過程視覺與操作都充滿魔法儀式感。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">結合部件類型、材質與元素親和，能創造出應對各種情境的完美構裝體！您隨時可命令它們返回工作台進行改造！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">指揮構裝體時，可使用指令鈴鐺下達基本命令（跟隨、返回工作台、駐守）。若需更高級控制，可使用導星方塊建立任務面板。將構裝體分配至導星方塊後，它們會依序執行任務。唯一限制就是您的想像力！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; padding-left: 210px;\"><img src=\"https://manaandartifice.com/wp-content/uploads/2022/08/lodestar.jpg\" width=\"717\" height=\"569\" /></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; padding-left: 240px;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\">影片教學/流程指南</h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">Mischief of Mice的Vallen製作了精彩的影片指南，完美涵蓋所有「魔力與工藝」內容！新影片持續更新中，歡迎訂閱他的頻道！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/v447_zeQQMo\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/5LGo5JvzaUw\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center; padding-left: 240px;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;<iframe",
